msgstr "CCT: %.0f K (svart legeme)"

#: ../src/iop/channelmixerrgb.c:3669
msgid ""
"approximated correlated color temperature.\n"
"this illuminant can be accurately modeled by a black body spectrum,\n"
"so its temperature is relevant and meaningful with a Planckian illuminant."
msgstr ""
"omtrentlig korrelert fargetemperatur.\n"
"denne lyskilden kan modelleres nøyaktig med et spektrum for et svart legeme,\n"
"så dens temperatur er relevant og meningsfull med en planckisk lyskilde."

