"forhåndsinnstillingen angir en filmstørrelse (35 mm) mens glideren er "
"bildets\n"
"lengste side (36 mm). begge beskriver det samme formatet."

#: ../src/iop/spektrafilm.c:5731
msgid " mm"
msgstr " mm"

#: ../src/iop/spektrafilm.c:5736
msgid ""
"physical frame size, long edge. sets the scale that grain, scatter,\n"
"halation and diffusion are all computed at, so a smaller format\n"
"shows every one of them proportionally larger for the same\n"
"print size."
